  "id": "contextual-analysis",
  "term": "contextual analysis",
  "definition": "Contextual analysis is an approach to examining how surrounding social, institutional, and environmental conditions shape how well a group, program, or activity works. It looks beyond formal structure or procedures to identify outside influences that help or hinder effectiveness.",
